abstract: >-
  Seeded discrete-event simulator of LLM-agent workflows on shared model, retrieval, tool and agent endpoints;
  the DAFC policy and conventional baselines; pre-registered experiment configurations, frozen parameters, seeds,
  trace manifests, analysis scripts, and validation evidence. Simulation only.
